<title>NETHERLANDS: European feeds close untraded ahead of Christmas.</title>
<headline>European feeds close untraded ahead of Christmas.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European meals and feeds market stayed untraded with unchanged seller prices on the last half trading day before the Christmas break, market sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;There were only few operators around as the market officially closed at noon. They left the seller prices unchanged and there was no buying interest at all,&quot; one broker said.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on December 27.</p>
<p>KAREL LUIMES +31 20 504 5832</p>
